    <string name="autosync_wake_explain">One system dialog. Android then watches for this sensor by itself, wakes the app when it is in range and lets it sync in the background while it is near.</string>
    <string name="autosync_wake_ble_drop">The Bluetooth link drops for the dialog and comes back after it.</string>
    <string name="autosync_explain">A background job copies new files with a progress notification. Android picks the exact moment and skips it on low battery. Joining a Wi-Fi network also starts a check. Files are checked exactly like Sync all, and the sensor is never asked to delete anything.</string>

